OL,3,GNEWSACouncil staff refused anonymity
OL,4,Afor Sara Sharif inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has rejected a request for
OL,7,Fanonymity made on behalf of three
OL,8,Fcouncil workers who are expected to
OL,9,Fgive evidence at the inquest into the
OL,10,Fdeath of Sara Sharif.
OL,12,FThe 10-year-old was found dead in a
OL,13,Fbunk bed at her family home in Woking,
OL,14,FSurrey, in August 2023.
OL,16,FHer father and stepmother ` Urfan
OL,17,FSharif and Beinash Batool ` were jailed
OL,18,Ffor life in December 2024 after being
OL,19,Ffound guilty of her murder.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
