OL,3,GNEWSACouncil staff refused anonymity
OL,4,Afor Sara Sharif inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a pre-inquest review hearing last
OL,7,Fweek, Surrey County Council applied to
OL,8,Fprevent the identities of the workers
OL,9,Fbeing reported by the press during the
OL,10,Ffull hearing, but that application was
OL,11,Fresisted by media organisations,
OL,12,Fincluding the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
